within Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C10A_LipidModifyingAgentsPlain.C10AA07_Rosuvastatin;
model Rosuvastatin "Rosuvastatin — default model: Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final"
  extends Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final;
  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><p>The default model of rosuvastatin: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.C_CardiovascularSystem.C10A_LipidModifyingAgentsPlain.C10AA07_Rosuvastatin.Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final\">Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final</a>, chosen among the models extracted from papers (reviewer verdict, ground-truth agreement, completeness). All models of rosuvastatin in this package:</p><ul><li><code>Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final</code></li><li><code>Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_final_final_model</code></li><li><code>Rosuvastatin_Macpherson2016_full</code></li><li><code>Rosuvastatin_Yang2011_PD_ldl_c</code></li></ul><h4>About rosuvastatin</h4><p>Rosuvastatin is a statin used to treat lipid metabolism disorders such as hypercholesterolemia, atherosclerosis, and related heart disease. It is an approved medicine, widely used, and also available in fixed combinations with other lipid-modifying agents.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q415159\">Wikidata Q415159</a> and the WHO ATC classification; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Rosuvastatin\">Rosuvastatin</a>.</p></body></html>", revisions = "<html><body><ul><li>10/2026 generated by pharmacolibrary-dev export.pharmacolibrary_models from default: parameters extracted from the paper by the pharmacolibrary-dev pipeline, model built by its engineer, reviewed: default</li></ul></body></html>"), experiment(StartTime = 0, StopTime = 86400, Tolerance = 1e-9, Interval = 1));
end Rosuvastatin;
